3,Somray language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/somray_language,"Somray, as a Pearic language within the Austroasiatic family, likely exhibits an analytic syntax typical of eastern Mon-Khmer languages, characterized by head-initial structures and minimal inflectional morphology.",Somray,Austro-Asiatic
