9,ww-article-cache-1.s3.amazonaws.com/en/Somray_language,https://ww-article-cache-1.s3.amazonaws.com/en/Somray_language,"Austroasiatic language of Cambodia. Somray.Somray, or Northern Chong, is a Pearic language of Cambodia. Geographical distribution. [edit]. Somray is spoken in the following areas of Cambodia. Battambang province: Phumi Chhak Rokar area (Baradat ms.)",Somray,Austro-Asiatic
